Kalacon.device is a console.device replacement, with ONLY
CMD_WRITE-command supported. 

It's advantages are:

- Ansi palette works 100%, no red<->white messing up.
- If screen is 16 colored, it emulatates EGA display.

And disadvantages:

- No OS snapping
- Can be a bit slower, though I haven't noticed any difference on my 030/50.

If you want the sourcecode, ask me.

